== Overview ==
The Krampus Toilet was released in the [[Christmas Event Update]] 2024.

== Trivia ==
* He is based on a horned anthropomorphic figure who, in the Central and Eastern Alpine folkloric tradition, is said to accompany Santa on his visits to children during the night of 5 December (''Krampusnacht''; "Krampus Night"), immediately before the Feast of St. Nicholas on 6 December. In this tradition, Saint Nicholas rewards well-behaved children with small gifts, while Krampus punishes badly-behaved ones with birch rods.
* He is the boss of both Easy and Hard mode in the [[Santa's Workshop]] map.
* He is the first toilet to start with the letter K.
